# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 83b9958652eba57bc2ccedf1bebe57284402ace7af9c128a3839dd446e7e05ce
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 53e75d488774812c286183003c27fa668e05f7411762774c748c790af3927545
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm cc18aac4d62b4716e6413200bec9a6235188fabdbe0c43a3f7641f71827986cb
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 45af94aaf867f5bc83270a3666981e169e1035f696c2b2cd798b5a1f00f88fec
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes fff0b6b6d735ff36267f7d48bce6cce517547263804ff1e67aff553f8f81ffed
